    {
      "id": "evt-1996-02-17-1775582526046",
      "title": "Bulls vs Hawks",
      "start_date": "1996-02-14",
      "end_date": "1996-02-14",
      "category": "sports",
      "color": "#3b82f6",
      "artifacts": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "content": "I went to at least 3 Jordan games vs the hawks in the 90's and early 2000's. Tricia went with me to one on Valentine's day and I think this photo she took at that game. There's a whole story about me getting into an altercation with Spudd Webb after the game and being saved by Dennis Rodman. Maybe I'll tell and attach that story one day. 2 of the games I saw were when Jordan was with the Bulls, one was a playoff game I believe when he was with the Wizards. That ticket was given to me by Bonnie Holland who got it directly from Christian Laettner whom she was helping manage his finances."
        }
      ],
      "location": "Atlanta, GA",
      "cover_image": "/images/evt-1996-02-17-1775582526046/cover.jpeg",
